[00:00.00] 作词 : Roger Waters
[00:00.00][by:嗯一只漂泊的猫]
[00:00.20] 作曲 : Roger Waters
[00:01.20] 制作人 : Roger Waters/David Gilmour/Bob Ezrin
[00:06.96]I don't need no arms around me
[00:06.96]我不需要武力来禁锢包围我
[00:16.43]And I don't need no drugs to calm me
[00:16.43]我同样不需要毒品来麻痹自己
[00:25.49]I have seen the writing on the wall
[00:25.49]我已经看到了墙上的留言
[00:34.94]Don't think I need anything at all
[00:34.94]别以为我什么都愿意接受
[00:43.89]No!don't think I'll need anything at all
[00:43.89]不!别以为我什么都需要
[00:58.77]All in all it was all just bricks in the wall
[00:58.77]这一切都只不过是墙上的又一块砖石
[01:07.35]All in all you were all just bricks in the wall
[01:07.35]你们于我都不过是墙上的又一块砖石罢了
